Plain-language summary (the license texts are what count; this summary is not
part of them):

  - Personal, hobby, research and educational use is free.

  - A company with fewer than 100 people (employees and contractors, counting
    its whole corporate group) and less than 1,000,000 USD (2019, adjusted for
    inflation) revenue in the prior tax year may use VDWT free, including in
    closed-source products.

  - Any company, of any size, may evaluate VDWT internally for up to 90 days
    at no cost, under the evaluation license above (no production use).

  - Everyone else needs a commercial license: write to vdwt@proton.me.

